{"text":"大魏正光〔四年〕，歲次癸卯，四月八日，比丘僧安仰為師僧、父母、因緣一切含生，敬造釋迦像一。弟子生生尚得出家。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"僧安","refId":null,"text":"僧安","start":21,"end":23},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"出家","refId":null,"text":"出家","start":51,"end":53}]}